	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quando nihil sua autoritate, gratia, precibus senatus vester amplissimus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>apud vicinos profecit, ad conventum <placeName ref="l21">Badensem</placeName> ibitur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Cęterum, quia <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nullum illic responsum dari solet, nisi instructi veniant Urbium et <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Pagorum legati, rogatur iterum amplissimus senatus vester, ut foederatis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>indicata curet postulata, quę legati nostri afferent.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Si quid elicias, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quod nostra scire intersit, rogo, ne graveris privatim me monere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Cęterum quamvis necesse sit vicinis quoque rem patefieri, ne celatos se <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fuisse quęrantur, imo ne vacuos dimittant nostros hoc prętextu, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>cupimus tamen tardius paulo rescire, ne viam pręcludant.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quando <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>propter aeris intemperiem nondum animi causa peregrinari commodum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>esset, date saltem operam, ut statim a paschate vos hic videamus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Ego in id tempus, quam de literis d. <persName ref="p8041">a Lasco</persName> consultationem habendum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>esse scripsisti, reiicio.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, clarissime vir mihique inprimis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>honorande frater, cum d. <persName ref="p8111">Martyre</persName>, d. <persName ref="p8011">Gualthero</persName>, generis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>aliisque symmystis et tota familia.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Dominus vos magis ac magis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>benedicat semper!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l167">Genevę</placeName> 17. martii 1557.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Tuus <persName ref="p540">Ioannes Calvinius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Pręstantissimo viro et <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>eximio Christi ministro <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> fido pastori, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>fratri et symmystę colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
